  regionName: The Broken Banner Valley
  description: "Once guarded by an honorable samurai clan, this mist-covered valley
    now lies divided beneath torn banners. Rogue ronin stalk its roads, while samurai
    mages wield enchanted blades and forgotten spirit arts in a war over the valley\u2019s
    ancient power. Here, every broken oath leaves a curse\u2014and every fallen warrior
    may rise again."
